<title>SRI LANKA: Kelani up 4.17 pct on retail buying.</title>
<headline>Kelani up 4.17 pct on retail buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Kelani Tyres Ltd rose 4.17 percent or 25 cents to 6.25 rupees in early Wednesday trade on retail buying, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Retailers are capitalising on the general optimism in the market,&quot; said a broker who declined to be named.</p>
<p>Market sentiment was buoyed on Wednesday by news that the main opposition party had ratified an agreement with the government to work with it to end the ethnic war.</p>
<p>Kelani Tyre is Sri Lanka's biggest tyre maker.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
